<p>Fuel Fund		  1,450.0		     1,250.0</p>
<p>			    --------		    --------</p>
<p>    Total financing    4,652.3		    36,849.2</p>
<p>Government bonds to the amount of 90.4 million rand were redeemed during April 1997, the statement said.</p>
